      "updated": 1764075554657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Coding Agent Environment\n\n- TASK.md: explain the task.\n- The agent writes new methods in a `methods` folder\n  ahering to a common interface.\n- Each method can take arbitrary parameters from the \n  command line during a run\n- `pnpm predict --method average-color \n   --parameters '{\"redWeight\":1,\"greenWeight\":1,\"blueWeight\":1}' \n   --run-name baseline`\n- Each prediction creates a `predictions` and `qa` folder so\n  the coding agent can QA it's results. **this is what builds\n  the full feedback loop**",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Coding Agent Environment\n\n- TASK.md: explain the task.\n- The agent writes new methods in a `methods` folder\n  ahering to a common interface.\n- Each method can take arbitrary parameters from the \n  command line during a run\n- `pnpm predict --method average-color \n   --parameters '{\"redWeight\":1,\"greenWeight\":1,\"blueWeight\":1}' \n   --run-name baseline`\n- Each prediction creates a `predictions` and `qa` folder so\n  the coding agent can QA it's results. **this is what builds\n  the full feedback loop**",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
